0..78 Comment "// A record type\'s faces refused: one face holds a label the record lacks, and"
79..159 Comment "// one face is named twice. A static bracket refused: it names a field or a face"
160..234 Comment "// that the record type lacks. Another bracket fixes a field at a value of"
235..251 Comment "// another type."
252..254 Comment "//"
255..332 Comment "// A face lists only labels its record holds, and each face has its own name."
333..390 Comment "// The refusal stands at the label or at the second name."
391..467 Comment "// A static bracket fixes only the fields its record type writes, and a face"
468..544 Comment "// only when the type member names it. The refusal stands at the label or at"
545..622 Comment "// the face, by its name. A fixed value has its field\'s type, and the refusal"
623..646 Comment "// stands at the value."
647..649 Comment "//"
650..726 Comment "// The types stand in a module, whose members carry the verdict each refusal"
727..786 Comment "// states. Each refusal names the face and the record type."
787..789 Comment "//"
790..872 Comment "// - see: `model/desc/record-faces.gandr` — the faces read, and the bracket read"
873..954 Comment "// - see: `pathological/desc/shaped-signature.gandr` — a theory\'s faces refused"
955..965 Comment "//   alike"
